# Akal Pakal, First Among Equals {2}{U} triggers at "each player's end step" (CR 603.4): "if an artifact entered the battlefield under
# your control this turn". The three Moxen enter on turn 1, before it is cast on turn 3 with them; no artifact entered on turn 3, so
# Bot1's own end step does nothing. On Bot2's turn 4 Bot1 flashes in Cogwork Wrestler (an artifact creature) with two Islands, so at
# Bot2's end step it triggers: Bot1 looks at the top two (Ancestral Recall and Lightning Bolt), takes the Recall, and the Bolt goes to
# the graveyard.

